"description":"Rightway is your guide to better health. \n\nRightway empowers you with the tools, information, and experienced guidance to simplify your healthcare experience and get the most value out of your healthcare benefits. \n\nThe Rightway application connects you with a live, clinical health guide who helps you find the highest-quality healthcare at the best price. Your Rightway health guide is a trusted advocate who can help you  navigate every part of your healthcare journey. \n\nYour health guide can match you with the doctor you need, schedule your appointment at a convenient time, provide upfront pricing before an appointment, and even dispute bills on your behalf.\n\nHere are a few features of Rightway’s application that our members love:\n\nNeed clinical care? Your guide will:\nFind you a top-rated in-network doctor and make your appointment at a convenient time.\nAssess your symptoms and figure out the best next steps, like going to an urgent care or an emergency room.\nProvide upfront pricing for medical visits and pharmacy needs before you see a provider, get a service, or fill a prescription.\n\nUnexpected bill?\nSend it to Rightway and your health guide will explain the charges.\nIf something looks wrong, they’ll dispute it on your behalf.\n\nUse the app to:\nAccess your insurance card.\nUnderstand all of your healthcare and wellness benefits. \nView your prescription medications. \n \nConnecting with your Rightway health guide is easy and free, so start with Rightway every time you have a healthcare need to get the simplest, best care without overpaying. \n \nTo learn more, visit us at RightwayHealthcare.com.", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes":"75378688", "formattedPrice":"Free", "trackContentRating":"17+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":3.288889999999999869118028072989545762538909912109375, "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":135, "trackCensoredName":"Rightway Healthcare", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/ri